      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURN ALONG (2) has good early dash but last time was shuffled out the back and missed the frame, finishing fifth (24.45) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a good record here including four wins. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. BETTER BANJO (5) was a strong winner (19.92) from box 8 last time, scoring by 2 lengths at this track. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. DR. NATASHA (1) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a one length second (20.38) behind Jack Hook at this track. Well-placed to take this out. DR. HAROLD (7) is not to be discarded.",
